<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block subject %}{{ studio_name }}{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f4f4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: #333; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px; }
        .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05); }
        .header { background: #1a1a1a; color: #fff; padding: 32px 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 4px; font-weight: 600; }
        .header p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .content { padding: 32px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .content h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #1a1a1a; }
        .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #c8a97e; color: #fff !important; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500; margin: 8px 0; }
        .btn:hover { background: #a88a62; }
        .info-box { background: #f8f8f8; border-left: 3px solid #c8a97e; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
        .info-box dt { font-weight: 600; color: #777; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .info-box dd { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #1a1a1a; }
        .footer { background: #f8f8f8; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999; }
        .footer a { color: #c8a97e; text-decoration: none; }
        .stars { color: #f5b400; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>{{ studio_name }}</h1>
                <p>{{ studio_tagline|default('Photographe') }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                {% block content %}{% endblock %}
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p style="margin:0 0 6px;">{{ studio_name }} — {{ studio_city }}</p>
                <p style="margin:0;">
                    <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a> &middot;
                    {{ contact_phone }}
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#aaa; margin-top:16px;">
            Vous recevez cet email parce que vous avez interagi avec {{ studio_name }}. Toute réponse à cet email sera redirigée vers le photographe.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
